    "updated_at": "2021-07-27T20:57:52Z",
    "body": "Related to this, it would be nice if `starship print-config` could tell me which keys are the default values and which come from my config. This could perhaps be done by adding an extra flag that causes the default values to be written as comments (meaning I could replace my `starship.toml` with the output and end up with precisely the same set of keys actually specified, but including a reference for all the defaults). It could also be done by just adding a comment after each default entry, such as\r\n\r\n```toml\r\nscan_timeout = 30 # default\r\n```",
