    "body": "Also, the current output starts with\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n# Warning: This config does not include keys that have an unset value\r\n```\r\n\r\nAssuming there's actually a meaningful difference between a key having an unset value versus just being set to an empty string, this could be solved by listing these keys as comments, like\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n# some_unset_key = <unset>\r\n```\r\n\r\nI don't even know offhand what keys are affected by this though. Every key I've looked at has a defined default value.",
